@startuml UML时序图-作废申请与投票
' MultiBilling - 作废申请与投票时序图
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBD5E1
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F4F1
  ParticipantBorderColor #0F766E
  ActorBackgroundColor #E6F4F1
  ActorBorderColor #0F766E
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  GroupBorderColor #CBD5E1
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #F59E0B
}

title MultiBilling 作废申请与投票时序图

actor "管理员 A\n（发起人）" as A
actor "管理员 B / C" as B
participant "审核页面\nReviewPage" as Page
participant "作废服务\nVoidRequestService" as Service
participant "权限策略\nPermissionPolicy" as Perm
participant "投票策略\nVoidApprovalPolicy" as Policy
participant "作废申请仓储\nVoidRequestRepository" as RequestRepo
participant "投票仓储\nVoidVoteRepository" as VoteRepo
participant "条目仓储\nEntryRepository" as EntryRepo
participant "存档服务\nAuditLogService" as Audit

A -> Page : 对已审核条目发起作废\n填写原因并二次确认
Page -> Service : initiate(entryId, reason, adminA)
Service -> Perm : canInitiateVoid(adminA, entry)
Perm --> Service : true
Service -> EntryRepo : findById(entryId)
EntryRepo --> Service : entry(status = APPROVED)
Service -> RequestRepo : save(VoidRequest\nstatus = PENDING,\nadminCountSnapshot,\ndeadline = now + 72h)
Service -> Audit : record(VoidRequested)
Service --> Page : 202 Accepted

Page --> B : 生成“待我投票”任务\n（应用内待办）
B -> Page : 查看作废理由与条目存档
B -> Page : 投票“同意”并二次确认
Page -> Service : vote(requestId, AGREE, adminB)
Service -> VoteRepo : existsByRequestAndAdmin()?
VoteRepo --> Service : false
Service -> VoteRepo : save(VoidVote)
Service -> Policy : evaluate(adminCountSnapshot,\nagreeCount, deadline)
Policy --> Service : PASSED / VOTING / EXPIRED

alt 同意票满足严格多数（agree × 2 > adminCount）
  Service -> RequestRepo : status = APPROVED
  Service -> EntryRepo : entry.status = INVALID
  Service -> Audit : record(VoidApproved)
  Service --> Page : 作废成功，条目移入无效板块
else 未达多数且未超时
  Service -> RequestRepo : status = PENDING
  Service --> Page : 记录投票，继续等待
else 已超时
  Service -> RequestRepo : status = EXPIRED
  Service -> Audit : record(VoidExpired)
  Service --> Page : 申请失效，条目保持已审核
end

note over Service, Policy
  管理员总数在申请创建时快照，避免中途
  增减管理员导致阈值漂移；“半数以上”按
  严格多数实现，即同意票 > 管理员总数 / 2。
end note

note over Service, Audit
  同一管理员对同一申请只能投一票（唯一索引）；
  投票、状态变更与存档在同一事务内完成。
end note

@enduml
